++  - `host_computer` + `anyTabLeaseHeld()` + chrome/chromium hint in params JSON → `HOST_CHROME_TAB_LEASE`
++  - any exception → fail-closed `ORCHESTRATOR_GATE_ERROR` + `orchestrator.gate_error` warn + `logToolFinish`
