+|------|----------------------|----------|----------|-------------|
+| `companion/src/server.ts` | 2434 | 2183 | **1022** | **−1412** |
+| `companion/src/security/confirm-response.ts` | — | 320 | 320 | new (H1) |
+| `companion/src/ws/lifecycle.ts` | — | — | 1327 | new (H2) |
